view:
|
| aur-curator dev          Workspace: <root>
| Last Refresh: —
| ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
| │ [1] Packages   [2] Repository   [3] Settings   [4] Help   [q] Quit                                                                   │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │   aur-curator                                                                                                                        │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  aur-curator is a review-gated workflow tool for the Arch User Repository                                                            │
| │  (AUR). It provides a TUI dashboard to import, review, merge, build,                                                                 │
| │  confirm, and publish curated packages into a local pacman repository.                                                               │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  aur-curator never installs or uninstalls packages. Once a package is                                                                │
| │  published, install and upgrade it with plain pacman from the local                                                                  │
| │  repository ( pacman -S <pkg> ,  pacman -Syu ).                                                                                      │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  It also ships CLI subcommands for one-shot operations that do not require                                                           │
| │  the TUI.                                                                                                                            │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  ## Keys on every screen                                                                                                             │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  •  ^T : cancel the running operation (shown as  ^T Cancel  while one                                                                │
| │  runs). If none can be cancelled, the queued operations are dropped.                                                                 │
| │  •  ^C  or  ^Q : quit. With an operation running you are asked first:                                                                │
| │   y  quits;  n  or  Esc  stays.                                                                                                      │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  The Nav Menu, on every screen except Review:                                                                                        │
| │                                                                                                                                      │
| │  •  1  Packages (the Dashboard),  2  Repository (Repository Status),                                                                 │
| └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
| ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
| │ Operations                                                                                                                           │
| │ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
| │   Fetch                                                                                                                              │
| │   Analyze                                                                                                                            │
| │   Build                                                                                                                              │
| │   Publish                                                                                                                            │
| └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
| Idle
